t ___ be cold tomorrow.»", "o": ["will", "would", "is going to", "shall"], "e": "Выражение мнения → «will»."}, {"s": "Choose: «He ___ be at home; his car is outside.»", "o": ["must", "needn't", "shouldn't", "can't"], "e": "Сильное предположение выражается с помощью «must»."}, {"s": "Choose: «as long as» expresses:", "o": ["contrast", "condition", "reason", "time only"], "e": "Выражает условие."}, {"s": "Complete: «The teacher handed ___ the papers.»", "o": ["out", "off", "in", "up"], "e": "«Hand out» — раздавать."}, {"s": "Choose: «Provided that» is similar to:", "o": ["although", "because", "unless", "if"], "e": "Выражает условие."}, {"s": "Report: «Shall I open the window?» he said.", "o": ["He ordered to open it.", "He refused to open it.", "He offered to open the window.", "He denied opening it."], "e": "Выражает предложение."}, {"s": "Complete: «This room is twice ___ big as that one.»", "o": ["as", "more", "so", "than"], "e": "Сравнение кратности: twice as … as."}, {"s": "Complete: «Don't call at 8; I ___ dinner.»", "o": ["will be having", "have", "am having", "will have"], "e": "Действие, которое будет длиться в конкретный момент в будущем."}, {"s": "Complete the sentence transformation: «It's too expensive for me to buy.» = «It's so expensive ___ I can't buy it.»", "o": ["that", "as", "which", "so"], "e": "Конструкция «so … that»."}, {"s": "Complete: «We'll carry ___ with the work.»", "o": ["on", "out", "in", "off"], "e": "«Carry on» — продолжать."}, {"s": "Complete: «This book is ___ than that one.»", "o": ["interestinger", "interesting", "more interesting", "most interesting"], "e": "С длинными прилагательными употребляется «more»."}, {"s": "Complete: «He ___ a prize last year.»", "o": ["is given", "was given", "was gave", "gave"], "e": "В глаголах с двумя дополнениями подлежащим может быть лицо."}, {"s": "What does the prefix «mis-» mean?", "o": ["not", "before", "again", "wrongly"], "e": "Misunderstand — понять неправильно."}, {"s": "Complete: «He won't 